I am at Marine Drive.
I see a nice spot.
I sit on the wall.
The blue water is in front of me.
I watch the water.
There are many people here.
Some people look towards the sea.
Some people walk straight.
I look at the long road.
The curve of the road is very beautiful.
I think about my route.
I repeat the directions in my mind.
First, go straight by bus.
Then, turn left from the big intersection.
Finally, go towards the sea.
Now I know this route.
My home now connects to this place.
The map of Mumbai is now in my mind.
